  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; script-src 'self' https://assets.apollo.io https://d-code.liadm.com; frame-src https://i.liadm.com; connect-src https://aplo-evnt.com https://idx.liadm.com https://rp.liadm.com https://rpr.liadm.com https://api.rallywith.ai https://api.with-avalon.com https://p.rallywith.ai; worker-src blob:; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action https://api.rallywith.ai/access/downloads/redeem; frame-ancestors 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests

